# # /apodei/
#
# Persistent identifiers for apodei, a certify-on-use ledger of scientific
# claims. Every claim, act, certificate, policy and local entity id in the
# ledger is a content-addressed CIDv1 (base32, starting with "b"), and the
# ledger's certificate formats use predicate type URIs under /apodei/predicate/.
#
#   https://w3id.org/apodei/                     -> project home
#   https://w3id.org/apodei/predicate/<name>/<v> -> predicate specification
#   https://w3id.org/apodei/<cid>                -> project home for now; the
#       resolver of a public ledger node will be added by a later pull request
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Stefan Decker
# GitHub username: stefanjdecker

RewriteEngine on

# Certificate predicate type URIs, e.g. /apodei/predicate/lean4-proof/v1
RewriteRule ^predicate/(.+)$ https://github.com/stefanjdecker/apodei/blob/main/predicates/$1.md [R=302,L]

# Everything else, including ledger ids, goes to the project home until a
# public resolver exists
RewriteRule ^ https://github.com/stefanjdecker/apodei [R=302,L]
